("ADJ-225","gorgeous – (not usually compared)","'Gorgeous' is already extreme, so 'very' isn't added.","GORGEOUS: say it slowly — it sounds rich.","Informal: 'Gorgeous!' = beautiful, lovely.","Write a sentence about a gorgeous view.",None,"gorgeous vs beautiful","Beautiful = very attractive. Gorgeous = extremely beautiful (informal)."),
