("ADJ-231","modern – more modern – most modern","'Thinking' as a noun is uncountable. Use 'ideas' for countable thoughts.","MODERN: MODE of today.","'Modern-day' = present time.","Write a sentence about a modern building in your city.",None,"modern vs new","New = recently made. Modern = belonging to the present style.","She has very modern thinkings.","She has very modern ideas."),
("ADJ-232","old-fashioned – more old-fashioned – most old-fashioned","Keep the -ed ending: old-fashioned.","OLD + FASHIONED: made in the OLD fashion.","'Old-fashioned' can be warm: 'old-fashioned values'.","Write a sentence about an old-fashioned habit your grandparents have.",None,"old-fashioned vs old","Old = has existed a long time. Old-fashioned = in the style of the past."),
