("ADJ-234","classic – (not usually compared)","'Classic' = excellent and lasting. 'Classical' = ancient, or classical music.","CLASSIC = a CLASS above others, always.","'A classic mistake' = a very typical mistake.","Write a sentence about a classic film everyone should watch.",None,"classic vs classical","Classic = excellent and lasting (a classic film). Classical = traditional or ancient (classical music).","This is a classical film.","This is a classic film."),
