("ADJ-236","glamorous – more glamorous – most glamorous","'Glamour' is the noun. The adjective is 'glamorous' (no U before R).","GLAMOUR → GLAMOROUS: the U disappears.","'Glamorous lifestyle' = exciting and luxurious.","Write a sentence about a glamorous job.",None,"glamorous vs luxurious","Luxurious = very comfortable and expensive. Glamorous = exciting and attractive."),
